# Playwright API

This document summarizes the key Playwright APIs used by this project.

## Basics

### Launch a browser
- `chromium.launch()`
- `firefox.launch()`
- `webkit.launch()`

### Create a page
- `browser.newPage()`

### Navigate
- `page.goto(url, options?)`

## Common page interactions

### Click
- `page.click(selector, options?)`

### Fill
- `page.fill(selector, value, options?)`

### Type
- `page.type(selector, text, options?)`

### Wait
- `page.waitForSelector(selector, options?)`
- `page.waitForTimeout(ms)`

## Assertions (examples)

- `expect(locator).toBeVisible()`
- `expect(locator).toHaveText(text)`
- `expect(page).toHaveURL(urlOrRegExp)`

## Locators

- `page.locator(selector)`
- `locator.click()`
- `locator.fill()`
- `locator.textContent()`

## Tracing / debugging

- `context.tracing.start({ ... })`
- `context.tracing.stop()`
- `page.pause()`
